    "references": null,
    "body": "Hi Randi,\r\n\r\nI’m so glad you love it!\r\n\r\nThe dashboard currently shows the calendar in a list format, but I can add a visual calendar that automatically displays your upcoming appointments while keeping the request list too.\r\n\r\nPlease send me your exact cancellation and no-show policy. I’ll add a short version to the confirmation email, along with a reminder to arrive 5–10 minutes early.\r\n\r\nMarketing emails will be managed through the dashboard once I finish that section. Under U.S. CAN-SPAM rules, prior opt-in generally isn’t required, but every marketing email must provide a clear way to unsubscribe. I still recommend keeping the optional opt-in checkboxjust making it smaller and less prominent—because it creates a cleaner, more engaged mailing list. [FTC guidance](https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business)\r\n\r\nThank you again for the wonderful feedback! And the feedback we have for the work on your account from our CEO, is to ask you to concentrate on business development and not to worry about the site as we\r\nHave that end covered. You need something on the site you don’t see or come up with something all of a\r\nSudden. just say it. \r\nWe will make it happen :) \r\n\r\nBest,  \r\nJay\r\n"
